{"id":"1170b259facfb323","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-measure10-simple-function-code.md","title":"ZFC Measure10 Simple Function Code","display":"df-zfc-measure10-simple-function-code — ZFC Measure10 Simple Function Code","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure10-simple-function-code","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure10-simple-function-code"],"display":"df-zfc-measure10-simple-function-code — ZFC Measure10 Simple Function Code","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-set]]","[[58-df-measurable-space]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure10-simple-function-code"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure10-simple-function-code</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure10-simple-function-code — ZFC Measure10 Simple Function Code"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"58-df-set\">58-df-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7f96c502a4a99a46\" href=\"?note=7f96c502a4a99a46\" title=\"58-df-measurable-space\">58-df-measurable-space</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in V\">\\(X\\in V\\)</span> (measurable-space carrier)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\Sigma\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span> (sigma algebra)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> (simple-function code)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span> (finite code length)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,c\\in V\">\\(A,c\\in V\\)</span> (partition and coefficient function graphs)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,j\\in n\">\\(i,j\\in n\\)</span> (finite indices bound in the assertion)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasurableSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasurableSpace}_S\\)</span> (source predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function-graph predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10SimpleFunctionCode}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10SimpleFunctionCode}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure10\\text{-}simple\\text{-}function\\text{-}code} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10SimpleFunctionCode}_S(s,X,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MeasurableSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma)\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists A,c\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\\mathrm{Function}(A,n,\\Sigma)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(c,n,\\mathbb R)\\land\\forall i,j\\in n\\;(i\\neq j\\to A(i)\\cap A(j)=\\varnothing)\\land X=\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(A)\\land s=\\langle A,c\\rangle\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure10\\text{-}simple\\text{-}function\\text{-}code} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10SimpleFunctionCode}_S(s,X,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MeasurableSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma)\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists A,c\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\\mathrm{Function}(A,n,\\Sigma)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(c,n,\\mathbb R)\\land\\forall i,j\\in n\\;(i\\neq j\\to A(i)\\cap A(j)=\\varnothing)\\land X=\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(A)\\land s=\\langle A,c\\rangle\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The two code components are explicit function graphs, and the measurable sets form a finite partition of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-measurable-space","status":"resolved","id":"7f96c502a4a99a46","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-measurable-space]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"A,c\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"i,j\\in n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MeasurableSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10SimpleFunctionCode}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure10\\text{-}simple\\text{-}function\\text{-}code} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10SimpleFunctionCode}_S(s,X,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MeasurableSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma)\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists A,c\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\\mathrm{Function}(A,n,\\Sigma)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(c,n,\\mathbb R)\\land\\forall i,j\\in n\\;(i\\neq j\\to A(i)\\cap A(j)=\\varnothing)\\land X=\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(A)\\land s=\\langle A,c\\rangle\\Bigr]","display":true},{"tex":"X","display":false}],"bytes":1470,"backlinks":[{"id":"acac1315890d72f8","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2552","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-measure10-simple-function-code.md|58-df-zfc-measure10-simple-function-code]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","36d7463d215be751","65d9a1e690c32aad","7f96c502a4a99a46"]}